      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "To avoid in-stent restenosis, a new technologic approach with \"coated\" stents may deliver local cytostatic products (sirolimus, paclitaxel, tacrolimus...). At this time, present clinical studies validate the importance of these active coated stents in sub-groups of patients with diabetes, long lesions, small vessels and proximal left anterior descending coronary lesions."},
